    {
      "id": "BossTrade",
      "text": {
        "en-us": "You: Who buys your glowcaps? / Glimmerbough: My friend. I send glowcaps down the deep tunnel, and amber comes back up. Good amber, like drops of sunlight. / You: Your glowcaps paid for Snikkit's painted gold, and that gold paid the Baron's sellswords. Your friend is using you.",
        "id-id": "You: Siapa yang membeli glowcap-mu? / Glimmerbough: Sahabatku. Aku mengirim glowcap ke bawah lewat terowongan dalam, lalu amber datang kembali ke atas. Amber yang bagus, seperti tetesan cahaya matahari. / You: Glowcap-mu membayar emas palsu Snikkit, dan emas itu membayar tentara bayaran sang Baron. Sahabatmu memanfaatkanmu."
      },
